#: r2/lib/system_messages.py:36 r2/lib/system_messages.py:76
msgid "Welcome! You are now a moderator"
msgstr "Selamat datang! Kamu sekarang moderator"

#: r2/lib/system_messages.py:37
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Congratulations!** You have been added as a moderator to [%(title)s](%(url)s).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"## Welcome to the Tippr Moderator Community!\n"
"\n"
"As a moderator, you play a vital role in building and maintaining our community. Here are some important things to know:\n"
"\n"
"### Your Responsibilities\n"
"\n"
"- Enforce vault rules and site-wide policies\n"
"- Foster a welcoming environment for community members\n"
"- Review reports and take appropriate action\n"
"- Collaborate with fellow moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Important Resources\n"
"\n"
"- [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines) - Learn about best practices and expectations\n"
"- [Content Policy](/help/contentpolicy) - Understand site-wide rules\n"
"- [User Agreement](/help/useragreement) - Know the terms of service\n"
"- [/v/ModSupport](/v/ModSupport) - Connect with other moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Volunteer Status\n"
"\n"
"Please note that moderators are independent volunteers, not employees of Tippr. For more details, please review the [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for helping make Tippr a great place!"
msgstr ""
"**Selamat!** Kamu telah ditambahkan sebagai moderator di [%(title)s](%(url)s).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"## Selamat Datang di Komunitas Moderator Tippr!\n"
"\n"
"Sebagai moderator, kamu berperan penting dalam membangun dan menjaga komunitas kami. Berikut beberapa hal penting yang perlu diketahui:\n"
"\n"
"### Tanggung Jawabmu\n"
"\n"
"- Menegakkan aturan vault dan kebijakan seluruh situs\n"
"- Menciptakan suasana yang ramah bagi anggota komunitas\n"
"- Meninjau laporan dan mengambil tindakan yang sesuai\n"
"- Bekerja sama dengan sesama moderator\n"
"\n"
"### Sumber Daya Penting\n"
"\n"
"- [Pedoman Moderator](/help/moderatorguidelines) - Pelajari praktik terbaik dan harapan\n"
"- [Kebijakan Konten](/help/contentpolicy) - Pahami aturan seluruh situs\n"
"- [Perjanjian Pengguna](/help/useragreement) - Ketahui ketentuan layanan\n"
"- [/v/ModSupport](/v/ModSupport) - Terhubung dengan moderator lain\n"
"\n"
"### Status Relawan\n"
"\n"
"Perlu diingat bahwa moderator adalah relawan independen, bukan karyawan Tippr. Untuk detail lebih lanjut, silakan baca [Pedoman Moderator](/help/moderatorguidelines).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"Terima kasih telah membantu menjadikan Tippr tempat yang hebat!"

