msgstr "Di setelan aplikasi, tambahkan webhook untuk Checkout order approved, Payment capture completed, denied, dan refunded."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:154
msgid "Buyers pay on Stripe Checkout with a card, Google Pay, Apple Pay, Link and any other method turned on in the Stripe dashboard (Settings > Payment methods)."
msgstr "Pembeli membayar di Stripe Checkout dengan kartu, Google Pay, Apple Pay, Link, dan metode lain yang diaktifkan di dasbor Stripe (Settings > Payment methods)."

