msgstr "Dari dasbor Stripe: Developers > API keys. sk_test_… untuk pengujian, sk_live_… untuk pembayaran nyata."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:164
msgid "Under Developers > Webhooks, add an endpoint for checkout.session.completed, checkout.session.async_payment_succeeded, checkout.session.async_payment_failed, checkout.session.expired and charge.refunded."
msgstr "Di Developers > Webhooks, tambahkan endpoint untuk checkout.session.completed, checkout.session.async_payment_succeeded, checkout.session.async_payment_failed, checkout.session.expired, dan charge.refunded."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:171
msgid "Buyers pay in USDC (a dollar stablecoin) from Coinbase or any crypto wallet, through Coinbase Business checkouts. Coinbase Commerce, the old service, has shut down."
msgstr "Pembeli membayar dengan USDC (stablecoin dolar) dari Coinbase atau dompet kripto apa pun, melalui checkout Coinbase Business. Coinbase Commerce, layanan lamanya, sudah ditutup."

